# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Block palettes understand more questions
- *"What blocks should I use with poplar logs?"*, *"which blocks can I combine with deepslate?"*, *"what colors go with copper?"*, *"blocks to use with cherry planks"*, *"suggest blocks for mud bricks"* and *"what looks good with blackstone?"* now get a palette too
- Questions about what a block is *for* (*"what blocks can I use for a nether portal?"*) still go to the wiki
